  "prompt": "For each product in categories 15, 16 and 17 with a known launch date, show the launch date of the product launched just before it in the same category. Within a category, products follow each other by launch_date; when two products of a category launched on the same day, the lower product_id comes first. Leave out products with a missing launch_date. Return four columns, in this order: product_id, category_id, launch_date and prev_launch_date. Return one row for each such product. A category's first product shows prev_launch_date as missing. Any row order is fine.",
